  "incoming_learnings": "Fire-enclosure recovery needs an executable continuation, not merely a first escape click. Account for closed-door opening, renewed burning, damage funding and actual extinguishing. A known levitation splash introduces confusion gas and needs its own retirement plan. Preserve unknown identities, hazard gates, mandatory pickups and terminal exhaustion.",
